  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS. Passport production tender. 2023-2025.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide technical assistance to the Federal Government of Somalia (FGS) for the transparent, efficient and sustainable planning and execution of an international competitive tender process for contracting a passport services supplier in accordance with international best practices, standards and security regulations as defined by the international Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO).
The passport under the current supplier requires updating to ensure that the passport complies with the minimum ICAO 9303 security recommendations. A strengthened Somali passport which enjoys international recognition will boost the legitimacy of the Somali government and its relevant institutions, ensuring the rights of travellers holding a Somali passport are protected.</narrative>
  </description>
